{"shortDescription":"TORONTO, Canada, Nov. 04, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Canadian General Investments, Limited (CGI) TSX:CGI LSE:CGI reports on an unaudited basis that its net asset value per share (NAV) at October 31, 2026 was $84.06 resulting in year-to-date and 12-month NAV returns, with dividends reinvested, of 5.3…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["TORONTO, Canada, Nov. 04, 2026 ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com","linkText":"(GLOBE NEWSWIRE)"}}," -- Canadian General Investments, Limited (CGI) ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TSX:CGI","text":"TSX:CGI"}}," ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"LSE:CGI","text":"LSE:CGI"}}," reports on an unaudited basis that its net asset value per share (NAV) at October 31, 2026 was $84.06 resulting in year-to-date and 12-month NAV returns, with dividends reinvested, of 5.3% and 3.9%, respectively. These compare with the 14.4% and 20.4% returns of the benchmark S\u0026P/TSX Composite Index on a total return basis for the same periods."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Company employs a leveraging strategy, by way of bank borrowing, with the intent to enhance returns to common shareholders. As at October 31, 2026, the leverage represented 12.8% of CGI’s net assets, up from 11.9% at the end of 2025 and 11.7% at October 31, 2025."]},{"type":"p","children":["The closing price for CGI’s common shares at October 31, 2026 was $51.20, resulting in year-to-date and 12-month share price returns, with dividends reinvested, of 10.3% and 16.4%, respectively."]},{"type":"p","children":["The sector weightings of CGI’s investment portfolio at market as of October 31, 2026 were as follows:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Industrials"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["21.0"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["%"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data